{"id":"ca39023cb294c484","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy.md","title":"Hyperarithmetical Hierarchy","display":"df-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy — Hyperarithmetical Hierarchy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy","aliases":["88-df-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy"],"display":"df-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy — Hyperarithmetical Hierarchy","depends_on":["[[88-df-ordinal-notation]]","[[88-df-hyperarithmetical-def]]","[[88-lem-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy-existence]]","[[88-df-iota-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy — Hyperarithmetical Hierarchy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b23177f17eeaa7a2\" href=\"?note=b23177f17eeaa7a2\" title=\"88-df-ordinal-notation\">88-df-ordinal-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6587ae27f7ed289f\" href=\"?note=6587ae27f7ed289f\" title=\"88-df-hyperarithmetical-def\">88-df-hyperarithmetical-def</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e3111fd9385df4f\" href=\"?note=5e3111fd9385df4f\" title=\"88-lem-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy-existence\">88-lem-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy-existence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"03af5095ed087251\" href=\"?note=03af5095ed087251\" title=\"88-df-iota-operator\">88-df-iota-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_{88}\">\\(\\mathcal O_{88}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b23177f17eeaa7a2\" href=\"?note=b23177f17eeaa7a2\" title=\"88-df-ordinal-notation\">88-df-ordinal-notation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\">\\(a\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\)</span> 为具体序数记号。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HyperJumpSys}_{88}(\\mathcal H)\">\\(\\mathrm{HyperJumpSys}_{88}(\\mathcal H)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6587ae27f7ed289f\" href=\"?note=6587ae27f7ed289f\" title=\"88-df-hyperarithmetical-def\">88-df-hyperarithmetical-def</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists!\\mathcal H\\;\\mathrm{HyperJumpSys}_{88}(\\mathcal H)\">\\(\\exists!\\mathcal H\\;\\mathrm{HyperJumpSys}_{88}(\\mathcal H)\\)</span> 由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5e3111fd9385df4f\" href=\"?note=5e3111fd9385df4f\" title=\"88-lem-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy-existence\">88-lem-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy-existence</a> 给出。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\\mathcal H\\,\\theta(\\mathcal H)\">\\(\\iota\\mathcal H\\,\\theta(\\mathcal H)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"03af5095ed087251\" href=\"?note=03af5095ed087251\" title=\"88-df-iota-operator\">88-df-iota-operator</a> 对背景集合论公式及其绑定变量定义的唯一描述；公式中固定编号等环境参数完整保留。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H_{88}\">\\(\\mathcal H_{88}\\)</span> 为所定义的唯一层级函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_a\">\\(H_a\\)</span> 为它在记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 上的值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hyperarithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\mathcal H_{88}\\coloneqq\n\\iota\\mathcal H\\;\\mathrm{HyperJumpSys}_{88}(\\mathcal H)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hyperarithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\mathcal H_{88}\\coloneqq\n\\iota\\mathcal H\\;\\mathrm{HyperJumpSys}_{88}(\\mathcal H)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hyperarithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HyperJumpSys}_{88}(\\mathcal H_{88})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hyperarithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HyperJumpSys}_{88}(\\mathcal H_{88})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hyperarithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\forall a\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\quad H_a\\coloneqq\\mathcal H_{88}(a),\n\\qquad (H_a)_{a\\in\\mathcal O_{88}}=\\mathcal H_{88}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hyperarithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\forall a\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\quad H_a\\coloneqq\\mathcal H_{88}(a),\n\\qquad (H_a)_{a\\in\\mathcal O_{88}}=\\mathcal H_{88}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第二个断言由存在唯一性引理与唯一描述的消去等价式推出，不是额外的层级公理。所有描述项的出现均引用真实存在的定义文件，且不再只在注释中解释绑定算子。</p>\n<p>层以具体记号而非抽象序数为索引；定义没有把表示同一序数的不同记号强行识别。后继与极限子句只有 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"6587ae27f7ed289f\" href=\"?note=6587ae27f7ed289f\" title=\"88-df-hyperarithmetical-def\">88-df-hyperarithmetical-def</a> 一个正式来源，本文件只引入具体函数与层记号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-ordinal-notation","status":"resolved","id":"b23177f17eeaa7a2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-ordinal-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-hyperarithmetical-de