[88-df-hyperarithmetical-def]] 一个正式来源，本文件只引入具体函数与层记号。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal O_{88}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathcal O_{88}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HyperJumpSys}_{88}(\\mathcal H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists!\\mathcal H\\;\\mathrm{HyperJumpSys}_{88}(\\mathcal H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota\\mathcal H\\,\\theta(\\mathcal H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H_{88}","display":false},{"tex":"H_a","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hyperarithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\mathcal H_{88}\\coloneqq\n\\iota\\mathcal H\\;\\mathrm{HyperJumpSys}_{88}(\\mathcal H)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hyperarithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HyperJumpSys}_{88}(\\mathcal H_{88})","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hyperarithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\forall a\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\quad H_a\\coloneqq\\mathcal H_{88}(a),\n\\qquad (H_a)_{a\\in\\mathcal O_{88}}=\\mathcal H_{88}","display":true}],"bytes":1988,"backlinks":[{"id":"6587ae27f7ed289f","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这里仅定义“满足递归子句”的性质。系统存在唯一性由 [[88-lem-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy-existence]] 证明，具体层 $H_a$ 由 [[88-df-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy]] 引入。名称中的 jump system 指普通图灵跳跃的超限迭代，不是通常也称 hyperjump 的 Kleene $\\mathcal O$ 相对化算子。"},{"id":"a8bec8cb4c1a4891","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$H_a$ (iterated-jump level, see [[88-df-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy]])"},{"id":"c261b0ab1c6bf486","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HYP}$ 见 [[88-df-hyperarithmetical]]；$H_a$ 见 [[88-df-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy]]，其递归子句见 [[88-df-hyperarithmetical-def]]。"},{"id":"0d1300ef33ffd8df","anchor":"ref-142","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[88-df-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy]]；[[88-df-iota-operator]]；[[88-lem-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy-existence]]"},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","a